Use the MIME type `application/pdf`.

Allow users to save to:

- A folder on the device.
- A user-selected external storage location.
- A supported document provider, including cloud-backed providers exposed by Android.

Cloud destinations are optional system-provided destinations, not a cloud backend implemented by this app.

Do not require the user to grant unrestricted filesystem access.

Where appropriate, provide a default filename in the system save dialog.

If the user cancels the save dialog, return safely to the previous screen without losing the editable document session.

After a successful save, display:

- PDF filename.
- Page count.
- File size.
- Save location when available.
- Preview PDF.
- Share PDF.
- Return Home.

Only report success after the output has been written successfully.

